#: ../../source/notebooks/18. 8540b6710df14b0b8963fb52913af67d Dynamic
#: Selection.ipynb:321 Symbol
msgid "Selecting Symbols by Liquidity"
msgstr "按流动性选择品种"

#: ../../source/notebooks/18. 776e2b404afa4e7dbe6b1d57a97e66ac Dynamic
#: Selection.ipynb:323 Symbol
msgid ""
"Dynamic symbol selection is done with a `SymbolSelector "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.SymbolSelector>`__,"
" which can be any callable that takes a `Pandas DataFrame "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__ "
"and returns a sequence of symbols. Pass it to `add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__"
" in place of a fixed symbol list."
msgstr ""
"动态品种选择通过 `SymbolSelector "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.SymbolSelector>`__"
" 实现，它可以是任意接受 `Pandas DataFrame "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__ "
"并返回品种序列的可调用对象。将其传递给 `add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__"
" 即可替代固定的品种列表。"

